  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Movement - WASD

    Jump - space

    Dash - shift

    Slide - alt /
    side MB (aka back button)

    Aim - Ctrl (hold)

    Target Lock - q / Middle
    MB

    Light combo - Left MB

    Heavy attack - Left MB (hold)

    Parry -
    Right MB

    Shoot - Left MB while aiming

    *MB = mouse button


    You
    can run on blue walls, can ride on ropes.

    You can dash trough green force
    fields, but not trough red ones.

    You need to kill all enemies to unlock
    doors.

    In case of bugs, resetting may help.





'
